# The key every verb in this folder reads. `pinecall link` writes it here, for the org you pick;
# a server keeps a server's token from the console's Tokens screen in its own secrets instead.
PINECALL_KEY=
# Only when the gateway is not https://cloud.pinecall.io — `link --gateway <url>` writes it too.
# PINECALL_URL=http://127.0.0.1:8080
